## Credits

The animated pixel-art of Clawd used by this project comes from **MyClawd** by
**CodeChrisB** (https://github.com/CodeChrisB/MyClawd, live at
https://codechrisb.github.io/MyClawd/). The PNG frames in `frames/` and the GIFs
in `docs/animations/` are converted from that project's animation sets (cropped,
background removed, crab recoloured blue). MyClawd is a fan project and ships no
license, so the artwork is included here for personal, non-commercial use only
— ask the author before redistributing it.

"Clawd" is the mascot of Anthropic's Claude Code. Anthropic keeps the rights to
the character; this package is a fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by
Anthropic.

dsh-TUI itself is by ccch1mneyyy and contributors (MIT). DeepSeek Harness
(`@deepseek-ai/dsh`) is by DeepSeek.

See `NOTICE.md` for details.
